@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 07. Counter Payment via RFID

|Counter Staff / POS|
start
:Initiate Checkout via RFID;

|Internal Wallet System|
if (Wallet Status Valid?) then (No)
  :Identify Rejection Reason;
  note right: e.g., Account Locked \nor Card Expired
  :Notify POS of Account Error;
  stop
endif

:Apply Eligible Promotions;

:Check Available Balance;

if (Sufficient Funds?) then (No)
  :Calculate Required Balance;
  :Notify POS of Insufficient Funds;
  stop
endif

:Reserve Payable Amount;
note right
  **Escrow State:**
  Funds are locked to prevent
  double-spending.
end note

|Payment Gateway|
:Execute Settlement;

|Internal Wallet System|
if (Settlement Success?) then (Yes)
  :Complete Fund Transfer;

  |Counter Staff / POS|
  :Finalize Order & Issue Receipt;
else (No)
  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Identify Gateway Error;
  :Restore Reserved Funds;

  |Counter Staff / POS|
  :Notify Payment Failure;
endif

stop
@enduml